# ADR-001: Generated single-tenant multi-user product baseline

## Context

This product is a downstream overlay on the Maistro engine. Product-specific
configuration must remain explicit without copying engine internals.

## Decision

Adopt the generated contract of `users_max={{ users_max }}`,
`auth_backend={{ auth_backend }}`, `channels={{ channels | join(',') }}`, and
`host_target={{ host_target }}`. Credentials are supplied only through the
runtime environment, and readiness fails closed when a selected integration is
not configured.

## Acceptance criteria

- Rendered values are importable as a typed, immutable configuration.
- Missing credential variables are reported by name without reading them into
  the configuration object.
- The engine dependency remains pinned to the reviewed substrate ref.

## Out of scope

Channel transports and identity-provider implementations remain
product-specific work; this scaffold defines their integration contracts only.
